<h1 class="email-heading">Welcome, {{user.firstName}}!</h1>

<p class="email-text">
  Hello {{user.firstName}}, welcome to the SpKuLeHaS app. Before you sign in,
  <strong>you need to create your password.</strong>
</p>

{{> button href=createUrl label="Create Password"}}

<p class="email-text">
  After that, you can start making reservations. We cannot wait to see the fond
  memories you create at our special cabin.
</p>

{{> info-box
  content=(concat "<strong>NOTE:</strong> The link above will expire <strong>" expiration "</strong> Mountain Time.")
}}

<p class="email-text">
  If the link has expired, go to the
  <a class="email-link" href="{{loginUrl}}">login screen</a>,
  enter your email, and click <strong>FORGOT PASSWORD?</strong> to create your
  password.
</p>
